# The last part of the VS demo captures (demo-vs-*.cmds `script` it), from the Start Race screen:
# the bot takes the controller (kart-bot.js), OK loads the race, and the capture runs through the
# flyover, the countdown (the bot's `[bot] go` line marks GO) and the first stretch of the race.
shot start-race
eval window.__mkwBot.start()
mark ok
click 500 430
waitlog 30 \[bot\] route
wait 30000
wait 15000
mark end
wait 500
